<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:breakout-mode="default" ac:type="fixed-width"><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="4cc483a1-cbed-486a-8eb3-350bec92b926" ac:name="toc" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="maxLevel">3</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="00a0b101-a5b8-408b-a94c-af26b7c8b0c8" ac:name="info" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="containerLevel">panel_c1</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>Owned by <ac:link><ri:user ri:account-id="redacted" /></ac:link>. Last reviewed <time datetime="2026-09-15" />. Status: <ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="79b89f4b-aa73-4ad4-9831-fb4ebc692e9a" ac:name="status" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Approved</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Green</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h1>Summary</h1><p>The system is <ac:inline-comment-marker ac:ref="c71e1480-41e4-45bc-b4c5-635dece28f67">three services behind one gateway</ac:inline-comment-marker>. This paragraph has <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, <u>underline</u>, <del>strikethrough</del>, <code>inline code</code>, H<sub>2</sub>O, E=mc<sup>2</sup>, <span style="color: rgb(191,38,0);">red text</span>, <span style="background-color: rgb(248,230,160);">a yellow highlight</span> and an emoji <ac:emoticon ac:emoji-fallback="🚀" ac:emoji-id="1f680" ac:emoji-shortname=":rocket:" ac:name="rocket" />.<br />This line follows a hard line break.</p><p>External link: <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/">PostgreSQL docs</a>. Parent page link: <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Engineering" ri:space-key="IMPTEST" ri:version-at-save="1" /><ac:link-body>Engineering</ac:link-body></ac:link>. Sibling-tree link: <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Product" ri:space-key="IMPTEST" ri:version-at-save="1" /><ac:link-body>Product</ac:link-body></ac:link>. Same-page anchor: <a href="#Failure-modes">jump to Failure modes</a>.</p><h2>Components</h2><table data-layout="default"><colgroup><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class="numberingColumn" /><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Language</p></th><th><p>Owner</p></th><th><p>Status</p></th></tr><tr><td class="numberingColumn">1</td><td><p>Gateway</p></td><td><p>Go</p></td><td rowspan="2"><p>Platform team</p></td><td><p><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="5944cd17-842c-472a-9176-45c673184d78" ac:name="status" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Live</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Green</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></td></tr><tr><td class="numberingColumn">2</td><td><p>Auth service</p></td><td><p>Python</p></td><td><p><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="e5dc96b6-c9d3-4811-8577-0746465da6a8" ac:name="status" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Migrating</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Yellow</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></td></tr><tr><td class="numberingColumn">3</td><td><p>Worker</p></td><td><p>Rust</p></td><td><p>Data team</p></td><td><p><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="97a669a4-99ba-4544-983b-d96713482211" ac:name="status" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Blocked</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Red</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></td></tr><tr><td class="numberingColumn">4</td><td colspan="3" data-highlight-colour="#DEEBFF"><p><strong>Total services</strong></p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Request flow</h2><ol start="1"><li><p>Client calls the gateway</p><ul><li><p>TLS terminates here</p></li><li><p>Rate limits apply</p><ul><li><p>Third-level bullet</p></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><p>Gateway forwards to a service</p></li><li><p>Service writes to Postgres</p></li></ol><h2>Configuration</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="0d07e6bb-a355-45ac-85e9-29b8d5ec7dc8" ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">yaml</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[gateway:
  port: 8080
  upstreams:
    - auth:9000
    - worker:9100]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:breakout-mode="default" ac:type="two_equal"><ac:layout-cell><h3>Pros</h3><ul><li><p>Simple deploys</p></li><li><p>Clear ownership</p></li></ul></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><h3>Cons</h3><ul><li><p>Extra network hop</p></li><li><p>Three runtimes to patch</p></li></ul></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:breakout-mode="default" ac:type="fixed-width"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Failure modes</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="496dcdf7-1ae5-48c2-8c08-eb590f8d4e61" ac:name="note" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="containerLevel">panel_c1</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>If Postgres is unreachable, every write fails closed.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:adf-extension><ac:adf-node type="panel"><ac:adf-attribute key="panel-type">note</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-attribute key="containerLevel">panel_c1</ac:adf-attribute><ac:adf-content><p>A note panel.</p></ac:adf-content></ac:adf-node><ac:adf-fallback><div class="panel conf-macro output-block" style="background-color: rgb(234,230,255);border-color: rgb(153,141,217);border-width: 1.0px;"><div class="panelContent" style="background-color: rgb(234,230,255);">
<p>A note panel.</p>
</div></div></ac:adf-fallback></ac:adf-extension><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="039ac4b5-48ff-40c6-af3b-372a8f5630bf" ac:name="warning" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="containerLevel">panel_c1</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>An error panel.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="fa68a90c-1651-4fb2-8b42-d610a04259fa" ac:name="tip" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="containerLevel">panel_c1</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>A success panel.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="fe6a5c0f-5460-40e2-a6ed-1b214ef7b65a" ac:name="panel" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="containerLevel">panel_c1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="panelIcon">:bulb:</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="panelIconId">1f4a1</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="panelIconText">💡</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="bgColor">#EAE6FF</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>A custom panel with a lightbulb.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="f2ff03ee-4d6e-4154-9487-7e54d385b567" ac:name="expand" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Expand: incident history</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>Two outages in 2025, both from certificate expiry.</p><table data-layout="default"><tbody><tr><th><p>Date</p></th><th><p>Duration</p></th></tr><tr><td><p><time datetime="2025-03-02" /></p></td><td><p>42 min</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><time datetime="2025-11-19" /></p></td><td><p>7 min</p></td></tr></tbody></table></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><blockquote><p>Make it work, make it right, make it fast.</p></blockquote><hr /><p style="text-align: center;">Centered closing paragraph.</p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>
